  {
   "k": "1noi4xy",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ can perform various ⟦1⟧. Operations all require at least one agent to perform, and many require more than one, with some powerful ones requiring three operatives, which is more than what a country can have without any additional bonuses. They also all need some level of network to have been built up in preparation.",
