   "k": "kqpju7",
   "en": "Operatives"
  },
  {
   "k": "zmj0hb",
   "en": "operations"
  },
  {
   "k": "ijh1q0",
   "en": "Operations all need preparation before they can be launched. This is usually produced ⟦0⟧, agents, or a cost in industry over time. Once preparation is done, an operation can have multiple phases. The most common is to have three phases: infiltration, performing the job, and exfiltration.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "1la4po7",
   "en": "equipment"
  },
  {
   "k": "1kiiax9",
   "en": "The success of the operations is depending on your ⟦0⟧ and their ⟦1⟧, your network strength in the Country and the general risk of the operation. Different Operations have different base classifications: some are very likely to success, while others are very risky. Plant False Intelligence has 0% risk, but instead it has high prerequisites to become available. Infiltration, Making Resistance Contacts, Preparing a Collaboration Government, and Rescue operations have a low risk of 10%. Capture Cipher, Stealing Blueprints, Strengthen Resistance, and Sabotage operations have a medium risk of 20%. Orchestrate Coup and Coordinated Strike have a high risk of 30%.⟦2⟧",
   "frags": 3
  },
  {
