   "en": "Operation phases"
  },
  {
   "k": "1yv0l1h",
   "en": "Each operation has 3 phases: an infiltration, an execution, and an exfiltration. Each of these phases are randomly chosen, with modifiers depending on technology, ⟦0⟧, and available ⟦1⟧. Each random phase rolled has different cost requirements. The sum of costs of these phases determines the total operation cost, unless the operation has already been conducted, at which point the operation cost can scale. Each operation rolls from the same infiltration and exfiltration phases, but execution phases are operation-specific.",
   "frags": 2
  },
